  "comments": "<p><i>Obverse</i><br>Die <strong>1</strong> - V to the left of U, &nbsp;thin font.<br>Die <strong>2</strong> - V to the left of U, &nbsp;thick font.<br>It is easy to distinguish them by thickness of horizontal stroke in letters <i>A</i>.<br>Die <strong>3</strong> - V under the left side of U, &nbsp;sanserif font.</p><p>Die <strong>4</strong> - V under the left side of U, &nbsp;font with serifs.</p><p><br><i>Reverse</i><br>Die <strong>A</strong> -uncut 'k' in 'Sk'.<br>Die <strong>B</strong> -'k' in 'Sk' cut in conjunction.<br><br><i>Combinations</i><br><strong>1</strong>+<strong>A</strong>: 1993.<br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/612c982da334b.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/612c982da334b.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><br><strong>1</strong>+<strong>B</strong> : 1994, 1994 set, 1996 set, 1997 set.<br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/612c9842c3439.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/612c9842c3439.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><br><strong>2</strong>+<strong>A</strong>: 1993.<br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/612c9855598ab.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/612c9855598ab.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a></p><p><strong>3</strong>+<strong>A</strong>: 2002.</p><p><strong>4</strong>+<strong>A</strong>: 2005-2007.<br>Picture: © Images courtesy of Alexandr Prokofyev.</p><p><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/66d40a85ca5ba.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/66d40a85ca5ba.jpg\"></a></p>",
